# 🚫 40. DUPLICATE CHARACTER STATE

When recruitment produces a character:

```text
CHAR_000321
```

the Game State System checks:

```text
MASTER_000001
      ↓
Owned Characters
      ↓
CHAR_000321 exists?
```

If:

```text
YES
```

the recruitment result cannot be committed.

The Recruit/AI layer must select another valid character.

If:

```text
NO
```

the character can be added.

