# 🌑 92. FINAL PHILOSOPHY

> **The Game State System is the heart of Aetheria's living world.**

The Core World Building defines:

> **What Aetheria is.**

The Game Manager defines:

> **How systems operate.**

The Time System defines:

> **When things happen.**

The RNG System defines:

> **What random result occurs.**

The AI System defines:

> **What decisions can be recommended or simulated.**

The ID System defines:

> **Which entity is involved.**

The Database System defines:

> **What information is permanently remembered.**

The Game State System defines:

> **What the world is like right now and how it changes.**

Therefore:

```text
                    AETHERIA
                       │
                       ▼
                 WORLD DEFINITION
                       │
                       ▼
                  GAME MANAGER
                       │
                       ▼
               GAME STATE SYSTEM
                       │
            ┌──────────┼──────────┐
            │          │          │
           TIME       RNG        AI
            │          │          │
            └──────────┼──────────┘
                       ▼
                  STATE CHANGE
                       │
                       ▼
                  CONSEQUENCE
                       │
                       ▼
                  WORLD EVOLUTION
                       │
                       ▼
                   ID SYSTEM
                       │
                       ▼
                 DATABASE SYSTEM
                       │
                       ▼
                PERSISTENT MEMORY
                       │
                       ▼
                 AETHERIA CHANGES
                       │
                       └──────────► CONTINUES
```

> **Aetheria is not a world where events simply happen.**
>
> **Aetheria is a world where events change the state of the world.**
>
> **And the state of the world determines what can happen next.**

This is the foundation of the **Aetheria World Simulation System**.
